<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>球场 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%90%83%E5%9C%BA/</link><description>Recent content in 球场 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%90%83%E5%9C%BA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>现场看球：买票选座、安检入场到散场挤地铁</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/watching-sports-live/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/watching-sports-live/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;从赛前买票到散场出站&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序，拆成五个细化场景：在 App 上挑座位买票、安检口排队进场、坐下跟邻座球迷寒暄顺便买吃的、为争议判罚跟全场一起喊、加时打完散场挤地铁。主角是你——第一次去美国现场看球的人，配角是拉你去的朋友 Dave、旁边座位的常客 Kayla，和安检口的安检员。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>